# Only the Vite app ships to Vercel.
#
# The CLI otherwise detects backend/ as a FastAPI service and offers to run it
# here. It cannot: it needs Postgres, a migration step before it serves, and a
# process that stays up — all of which live on Render. Excluding it also keeps
# the upload to the app being built.
backend/
frontend/
docs/
dist/
*.db
